<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="tr" data-tema="aydinlik">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Hata · OzgurAPP</title>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Sora:wght@400;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
:root{--bg:#f7f5f2;--yazi:#2d2926;--yazi2:#70675f;--vurgu:#c45d3e;--hata:#b64d3b}
*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}
body{font-family:'Sora',sans-serif;background:var(--bg);color:var(--yazi);min-height:100vh;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;text-align:center;padding:24px}
.sayi{font-size:100px;font-weight:700;color:var(--hata);line-height:1;opacity:0.7}
h1{font-size:22px;font-weight:600;margin:16px 0 12px}
p{color:var(--yazi2);margin-bottom:28px}
.btn{display:inline-block;background:var(--vurgu);color:white;padding:12px 28px;border-radius:10px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div>
  <div class="sayi">500</div>
  <h1>Bir Hata Oluştu</h1>
  <p>Beklenmedik bir sorun yaşandı. Lütfen tekrar deneyin.</p>
  <a href="/" class="btn">Ana Sayfaya Dön</a>
</div>
</body>
</html>
